Label><text>37: A leader who is more like a beggar! (2)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0039_37_A_leader_who_is_more_like_a_beggar_2.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0041" playOrder="41"><navLabel><text>38: A leader who is more like a beggar! (3)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0040_38_A_leader_who_is_more_like_a_beggar_3.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0042" playOrder="42"><navLabel><text>39: A leader who is more like a beggar! (4)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0041_39_A_leader_who_is_more_like_a_beggar_4.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0043" playOrder="43"><navLabel><text>40: A leader who is more like a beggar! (5)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0042_40_A_leader_who_is_more_like_a_beggar_5.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0044" playOrder="44"><navLabel><text>41: Because it is Mount Hua (1)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0043_41_Because_it_is_Mount_Hua_1.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0045" playOrder="45"><navLabel><text>42: Because it is Mount Hua (2)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0044_42_Because_it_is_Mount_Hua_2.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0046" playOrder="46"><navLabel><text>43: Because it is Mount Hua (3)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0045_43_Because_it_is_Mount_Hua_3.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0047" playOrder="47"><navLabel><text>44: Because it is Mount Hua (4)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0046_44_Because_it_is_Mount_Hua_4.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0048" playOrder="48"><navLabel><text>45: Because it is Mount Hua (5)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0047_45_Because_it_is_Mount_Hua_5.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0049" playOrder="49"><navLabel><text>46: Don’t be offended if something goes wrong (1)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0048_46_Dont_be_offended_if_something_goes_wrong_1.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0050" playOrder="50"><navLabel><text>47: Don’t be offended if something goes wrong (2)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0049_47_Dont_be_offended_if_something_goes_wrong_2.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0051" playOrder="51"><navLabel><text>48: Don’t be offended if something goes wrong (3)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0050_48_Dont_be_offended_if_something_goes_wrong_3.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0052" playOrder="52"><navLabel><text>49: Don’t be offended if something goes wrong (4)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0051_49_Dont_be_offended_if_something_goes_wrong_4.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0053" playOrder="53"><navLabel><text>50: Don’t be offended if something goes wrong (5)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0052_50_Dont_be_offended_if_something_goes_wrong_5.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0054" playOrder="54"><navLabel><text>51: Haha, what a great person has come (1)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0053_51_Haha_what_a_great_person_has_come_1.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0055" playOrder="55"><navLabel><text>52: Haha, what a great person has come (2)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0054_52_Haha_what_a_great_person_has_come_2.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0056" playOrder="56"><navLabel><text>53: Haha, what a great person has come (3)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0055_53_Haha_what_a_great_person_has_come_3.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0057" playOrder="57"><navLabel><text>54: Haha, what a great person has come (4)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0056_54_Haha_what_a_great_person_has_come_4.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0058" playOrder="58"><navLabel><text>55: Haha, what a great person has come (5)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0057_55_Haha_what_a_great_person_has_come_5.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0059" playOrder="59"><navLabel><text>56: Are you really a Taoist? (1)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0058_56_Are_you_really_a_Taoist_1.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0060" playOrder="60"><navLabel><text>57: Are you really a Taoist? (2)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0059_57_Are_you_really_a_Taoist_2.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0061" playOrder="61"><navLabel><text>58: Are you really a Taoist? (3)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0060_58_Are_you_really_a_Taoist_3.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0062" playOrder="62"><navLabel><text>59: Are you really a Taoist? (4)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0061_59_Are_you_really_a_Taoist_4.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0063" playOrder="63"><navLabel><text>60: Are you really a Taoist? (5)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0062_60_Are_you_really_a_Taoist_5.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0064" playOrder="64"><navLabel><text>61: Sect Leader! That one is the God of Wealth! (1)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0063_61_Sect_Leader_That_one_is_the_God_of_Wealth_1.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0065" playOrder="65"><navLabel><text>62: Sect Leader! That one is the God of Wealth! (2)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0064_62_Sect_Leader_That_one_is_the_God_of_Wealth_2.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0066" playOrder="66"><navLabel><text>63: Sect Leader! That one is the God of Wealth! (3)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0065_63_Sect_Leader_That_one_is_the_God_of_Wealth_3.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0067" playOrder="67"><navLabel><text>64: Sect Leader! That one is the God of Wealth! (4)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0066_64_Sect_Leader_That_one_is_the_God_of_Wealth_4.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0068" playOrder="68"><navLabel><text>65: Sect Leader! That one is the God of Wealth! (5)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0067_65_Sect_Leader_That_one_is_the_God_of_Wealth_5.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0069" playOrder="69"><navLabel><text>66: Don’t worry! I’ll make you win! (1)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0068_66_Dont_worry_Ill_make_you_win_1.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0070" playOrder="70"><navLabel><text>67: Don’t worry! I’ll make you win! (2)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0069_67_Dont_worry_Ill_make_you_win_2.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0071" playOrder="71"><navLabel><text>68: Don’t worry! I’ll make you win! (3)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0070_68_Dont_worry_Ill_make_you_win_3.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0072" playOrder="72"><navLabel><text>69: Don’t worry! I’ll make you win! (4)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0071_69_Dont_worry_Ill_make_you_win_4.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0073" playOrder="73"><navLabel><text>70: Don’t worry! I’ll make you win! (5)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0072_70_Dont_worry_Ill_make_you_win_5.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0074" playOrder="74"><navLabel><text>71: Something seems to have changed in Mount Hua (1)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0073_71_Something_seems_to_have_changed_in_Mount_Hua_1.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0075" playOrder="75"><navLabel><text>72: Something seems to have changed in Mount Hua (2)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0074_72_Something_seems_to_have_changed_in_Mount_Hua_2.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0076" playOrder="76"><navLabel><text>73: Something seems to have changed in Mount Hua (3)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0075_73_Something_seems_to_have_changed_in_Mount_Hua_3.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0077" playOrder="77"><navLabel><text>74: Something seems to have changed in Mount Hua (4)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0076_74_Something_seems_to_have_changed_in_Mount_Hua_4.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0078" playOrder="78"><navLabel><text>75: Something seems to have changed in Mount Hua (5)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0077_75_Something_seems_to_have_changed_in_Mount_Hua_5.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0079" playOrder="79"><navLabel><text>76: Rolling Stone Gathers No Moss! (1)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0078_76_Rolling_Stone_Gathers_No_Moss_1.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0080" playOrder="80"><navLabel><text>77: Rolling Stone Gathers No Moss! (2)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0079_77_Rolling_Stone_Gathers_No_Moss_2.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0081" playOrder="81"><navLabel><text>78: Rolling Stone Gathers No Moss! (3)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0080_78_Rolling_Stone_Gathers_No_Moss_3.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0082" playOrder="82"><navLabel><text>79: Rolling Stone Gathers No Moss! (4)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0081_79_Rolling_Stone_Gathers_No_Moss_4.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0083" playOrder="83"><navLabel><text>80: Rolling Stone Gathers No Moss! (5)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0082_80_Rolling_Stone_Gathers_No_Moss_5.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0084" playOrder="84"><navLabel><text>81: Fight? You are so done now (1)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0083_81_Fight_You_are_so_done_now_1.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0085" playOrder="85"><navLabel><text>82: Fight? You are so done now (2)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0084_82_Fight_You_are_so_done_now_2.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0086" playOrder="86"><navLabel><text>83: Fight? You are so done now (3)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0085_83_Fight_You_are_so_done_now_3.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0087" playOrder="87"><navLabel><text>84: Fight? You are so done now (4)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0086_84_Fight_You_are_so_done_now_4.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0088" playOrder="88"><navLabel><text>85: Fight? You are so done now (5)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0087_85_Fight_You_are_so_done_now_5.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0089" playOrder="89"><navLabel><text>86: What bullshit. I am the strongest! (1)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0088_86_What_bullshit_I_am_the_strongest_1.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0090" playOrder="90"><navLabel><text>87: What bullshit. I am the strongest! (2)</text></navLabel><content src="Text/0089_87_What_bullshit_I_am_the_strongest_2.xhtml"/></navPoint><navPoint id="body0091" playOrder="91"><navLabel><text>88: What bullshit. I am the strongest! (3)</t